Paragraph 1: "The E&E heuristic views the problem as a reinforcement learning instance and adapts the exploration-exploitation techniques for finding a set of high-skew directions. In particular, our goal is to select the next direction to evaluate sequentially to balance the explore-exploit trade-off. That is, starting with a small set of randomly selected directions, at each iteration, we either explore the space of possible directions or exploit the best possible directions found so far."

